# inc-9m0e: load orc-barbarian-seed1-opt0822 via the check script.
# A paralyzed player can press d at the prompt to open the sheet, then C for
# Conditions, and ESC back (inc-sg8d4). 0001 status at the prompt, 0002 Conditions.
# One malady per session: the health display is an else-if chain.
w
@while "Enter wizard mode" y
@choose "Genocide Everything"
s
w
@choose "Become Divine Champion"
"Conditions Paralyzed Test God" ENTER
@while "more --" SPACE
@while "ESC:Done" ESC
@expect "ray, magic"
@dump:status
d
C
@dump:conditions
ESC
ESC
@quit
